         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: breeze-icon-theme, fonts-lato, konsole, plasma-workspace, sddm-theme-breeze
Description: Boswas OS visual identity for KDE Plasma
 The Boswas OS visual identity, built from the Boswas OS logo (the gold and
 silver "b" mark), the brand typeface and one design system:
 .
  * Orbitron, the brand typeface (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  * ten Boswas OS presets (Horizon, the default, Midnight, Aurora, Slate,
    Carbon, Pearl, Ocean, Ember, Nebula, Classic): Plasma Global Themes,
    colour schemes, light/dark/lock wallpapers and Konsole profiles, and
    boswas-preset to switch between them
  * the Boswas and Boswas Light icon themes
  * Boswas Launcher, the session start-up splash, the Plymouth boot,
    shutdown and passphrase splash, and the login and lock screen art
  * the Boswas terminal prompt and welcome (boswas-welcome)
  * System Settings "About this System" branding and the screen lock policy
    (automatic lock after 10 minutes, enforced)
 .
 Defaults are delivered through an XDG configuration directory
 (/usr/share/boswas/kde-settings), so /etc/xdg and per-user settings keep
 precedence and no file of another package is modified.
